; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">이수자 학생들은</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">아래와 같이 학점인정 신청안내를 하오니, 기한내에 신청하여 학점을 인정 받으시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 신청대상 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2010학년도 신입생</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 중 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">“2009 고교-대학 연계 학점인정 프로그램”</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">이수한 자</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 신청기간 :</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> 2010. 3. 24(수) ~ 3. 31(수)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class